  "prefLabel": "Csp 405.03 Direct Costs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 405.03 Direct Costs. Scholarship awards may only be used to cover direct costs associated with an eligible program. Eligible students shall not receive the cash equivalent of a governor’s scholarship.\n\nSource. #13144, eff 12-9-20 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Csp 400); ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
